:''For the Saber from the Gacha, see [[Saber (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Saber the Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a [[Daily Bonus]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] increases health and grants immunity to most negative effects.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 369
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Saber the Cat
|name2 = Heroic Spirit Saber Cat
|name3 = Saber Alter Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Heroic Spirit Saber Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Saber Alter Cat''' when obtained from [[Holy War: Saber Alter]] (may be dropped on the first two stages but guaranteed on the third stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Her damage isn't that great across all forms, but she can be stacked and use to deal some moderate damage, while tanking the Floating enemy for a bit. Not that good.

==='''True Form'''===
Her usage stays the same, but is improved. She now has immunity to almost every effect in the game, along with improved health. She can be used to stall the opponent while you build your stack or money. She is still only viable against Floating enemies however, so use her with caution in stages that aren't all Floating.

