==Trivia==
*The reason for Saber the Cat turning into Saber Alter Cat is different from the reason [[Saber (Uber Rare Cat)|Saber]] turned into Saber Alter. While Saber the Cat turned as a result of despairing over not being summoned, Saber was transformed due to coming in contact with the corrupted Holy Grail and was forced to embrace her inner darkness.
*Saber Alter Cat was given Drain Immunity in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], and her descriptions were rewritten to say that she is immune to many debuffs instead of all.

